      "step_id": 0,
      "title": "Method details",
      "instruction": "The skin is an organ of interest for novel investigative strategies. A large-scale prototype has been developed and used to retrieve 5.2 million measurements from the human skin. Based on these measurements, we developed the first high resolution map of the electrical activity generated by the torso [1].",
      "substeps": [],
      "is_critical": false,
