    },
    {
      "step_id": 1,
      "title": "Method details",
      "instruction": "Note: Photon-pixel coupling refers to a simultaneous chain conversion of electrical signals into pixel values. (ie. parallel conversion of electrical signals to light signals to pixel values to percentage values).",
